OL,3,GNEWSAHow forestry scam drained pensions
OL,4,Ato buy 'flash cars'
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at Ethical Forestry always knew
OL,7,Fwhen their bosses were around.
OL,9,FEven though the business was on the top
OL,10,Ffloor of a Bournemouth office block
OL,11,Fthere was no mistaking their arrival.
OL,13,FYou could hear one of their "top of the
OL,14,Frange, flash cars" roaring into the
OL,15,Fparking area three storeys below,
OL,16,Faccording to former staff member Susan
OL,17,FCox.
